  "assertion_requirements": [
    "Catalyst snapshot receipt must precede dependent client evidence; lastUpdatedTime is freshness only.",
    "ACI audit and observed policy snapshot are linked evidence, not two independent changes.",
    "Native SD-WAN AuditLogEntry is context only; it does not prove site/VPN targeting or a disjoint change.",
    "The direct ACI drop is on the backend dependency, not the user-to-Service leg.",
    "A later permit is a new observation and does not remove the earlier drop interval.",
    "Cilium service settings are synthetic administrator configuration; routed VIP reachability is an explicit test precondition and provides no observed network-path evidence."
